1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,925
A wildfire swept through
the mountain town overnight.

2
00:00:03,916 --> 00:00:07,604
Hundreds of families lost their homes
and many people are still missing.

3
00:00:08,596 --> 00:00:11,421
Firefighters are battling
the flames in thick smoke.

4
00:00:12,388 --> 00:00:15,675
Rescue teams are searching the
burned streets for survivors.

5
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:19,910
The town is mourning, and neighbours
are gathering to share food and

6
00:00:19,922 --> 00:00:20,522
shelter.
